# SPA views

## Page files

- App screens: `apps/<app>/views/*.page.tsx` — default-export a React function component.
- Import platform from `@/lib` and `@/k`; UI from `@/components/ui/...`.
- Copy via `t('app.key')` — do not hardcode user-facing English when a key exists or belongs in locale.

## Patterns

```tsx
import { t } from '@/lib'
import { KAppStatus, KTable } from '@/k'

export default function GreetingList() {
  return (
    <>
      <KTable query="hellospec.greetings" paginated searchable emptyMessage={t('hellospec.empty')} />
      <KAppStatus />
    </>
  )
}
```

- Prefer `<KTable|KKanban|KCollection query="…" paginated searchable />` over bespoke list chrome.
- End list/form pages with `<KAppStatus />` when sibling apps do.
- Styling: CSS variables (`--kg-*`), `cn()` from `@/lib`. Prefer existing tokens over one-off colors.
- Shell layout is platform-owned — do not wrap every page in custom app chrome.

## Do not

- Import from deleted `packages/sdk-solid` or Solid JSX.
- Duplicate shadcn primitives under an app — use `@/components/ui`.
- Bypass Vite aliases (`@/`) with deep relative paths into `apps/core/spa`.
- Add page-local keyboard shortcuts for search/pagination/save — use keymap + `data-keymap-id` (see `keymap.mdc`).
